#. module: no_rfq_follow_up
#: model:mail.template,body_html:no_rfq_follow_up.template_rfq_reminder_3
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"    <p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n"
"        Hello <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name or ''\">there</t>,\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        This is a final reminder regarding our Request for Quotation\n"
"        <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" t-out=\"object.name or ''\">P00001</span>,\n"
"        which remains unanswered.\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        If we do not hear back from you shortly, we will need to source this\n"
"        purchase elsewhere. We would much rather work with you — please\n"
"        send your quotation, or let us know your situation, today.\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        Reply to this email or contact\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.name or object.company_id.name or ''\"/>.\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        Best regards,\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.name or object.company_id.name or ''\"/>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"    <p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n"
"        Bonjour <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name or ''\">there</t>,\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        Ceci est un dernier rappel concernant notre demande de prix\n"
"        <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" t-out=\"object.name or ''\">P00001</span>,\n"
"        qui reste sans réponse.\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        Sans nouvelle de votre part dans les meilleurs délais, nous serons\n"
"        contraints de nous approvisionner auprès d'un autre fournisseur. Nous\n"
"        préférerions de loin travailler avec vous — veuillez nous transmettre\n"
"        votre offre ou nous informer de votre situation dès aujourd'hui.\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        Répondez à cet e-mail ou contactez\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.name or object.company_id.name or ''\"/>.\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        Cordialement,\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.name or object.company_id.name or ''\"/>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "

#. module: no_rfq_follow_up
#: model:mail.template,body_html:no_rfq_follow_up.template_rfq_reminder_2
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"    <p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n"
"        Hello <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name or ''\">there</t>,\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        We are still awaiting your response to our Request for Quotation\n"
"        <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" t-out=\"object.name or ''\">P00001</span>.\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        To keep this purchase on schedule, we would appreciate receiving your\n"
"        quotation as soon as possible. If you are unable to quote, a quick note\n"
"        letting us know would be very helpful.\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        Please reply to this email or contact\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.name or object.company_id.name or ''\"/>.\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        Best regards,\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.name or object.company_id.name or ''\"/>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"    <p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n"
"        Bonjour <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name or ''\">there</t>,\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        Nous attendons toujours votre réponse à notre demande de prix\n"
"        <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" t-out=\"object.name or ''\">P00001</span>.\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        Afin de respecter le calendrier de cette commande, nous vous serions\n"
"        reconnaissants de bien vouloir nous faire parvenir votre offre dans les\n"
"        meilleurs délais. Si vous n'êtes pas en mesure de répondre, un bref\n"
"        message de votre part nous serait très utile.\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        Veuillez répondre à cet e-mail ou contacter\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.name or object.company_id.name or ''\"/>.\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        Cordialement,\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.name or object.company_id.name or ''\"/>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "

#. module: no_rfq_follow_up
#: model:mail.template,body_html:no_rfq_follow_up.template_rfq_reminder_1
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"    <p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n"
"        Hello <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name or ''\">there</t>,\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        We recently sent you our Request for Quotation\n"
"        <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" t-out=\"object.name or ''\">P00001</span>\n"
"        and wanted to follow up to see whether you have had a chance to review it.\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        We have not received your quotation yet. Could you share your pricing,\n"
"        lead time and availability when convenient? Simply reply to this email\n"
"        or get in touch with\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.name or object.company_id.name or ''\"/>.\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        Thank you — we look forward to working with you.\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        Best regards,\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.name or object.company_id.name or ''\"/>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"    <p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n"
"        Bonjour <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name or ''\">there</t>,\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        Nous vous avons récemment envoyé notre demande de prix\n"
"        <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" t-out=\"object.name or ''\">P00001</span>\n"
"        et souhaitions vous relancer pour savoir si vous avez eu l'occasion de la consulter.\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        Nous n'avons pas encore reçu votre offre. Pourriez-vous nous communiquer\n"
"        vos tarifs, délais et disponibilités dès que possible ? Répondez simplement\n"
"        à cet e-mail ou prenez contact avec\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.name or object.company_id.name or ''\"/>.\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        Nous vous en remercions et espérons collaborer avec vous.\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        Cordialement,\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.name or object.company_id.name or ''\"/>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "

#. module: no_rfq_follow_up
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:no_rfq_follow_up.field_purchase_order__x_rfq_reminder_enabled
msgid "Auto-Chase Vendor"
msgstr "Relance automatique du fournisseur"

#. module: no_rfq_follow_up
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:no_rfq_follow_up.res_config_settings_view_form_rfq_follow_up
msgid ""
"Automatically email vendors an escalating reminder while a sent RFQ stays "
"unanswered"
msgstr ""
"Envoyer automatiquement aux fournisseurs des rappels progressifs tant qu'une "
"demande de prix envoyée reste sans réponse"

#. module: no_rfq_follow_up
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:no_rfq_follow_up.field_purchase_order__x_rfq_reminder_sent
msgid ""
"Comma-separated tokens marking which follow-up reminders have already fired "
"for this RFQ (e.g. 'r1,r2'). Used by the daily cron to avoid sending the "
"same reminder twice."
msgstr ""
"Jetons séparés par des virgules indiquant les rappels de relance déjà envoyés "
"pour cette demande de prix (ex. : « r1,r2 »). Utilisé par la tâche planifiée "
"quotidienne pour éviter d'envoyer deux fois le même rappel."

#. module: no_rfq_follow_up
#: model:ir.model,name:no_rfq_follow_up.model_res_config_settings
msgid "Config Settings"
msgstr "Paramètres de configuration"

#. module: no_rfq_follow_up
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:no_rfq_follow_up.field_res_config_settings__rfq_reminder_offset_3
msgid ""
"Days after an RFQ is sent before the final follow-up email is sent, with the"
" buyer copied in. Should be larger than the second reminder."
msgstr ""
"Nombre de jours après l'envoi d'une demande de prix avant l'envoi du dernier "
"e-mail de relance, avec l'acheteur en copie. Doit être supérieur au délai du "
"deuxième rappel."

#. module: no_rfq_follow_up
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:no_rfq_follow_up.field_res_config_settings__rfq_reminder_offset_1
msgid ""
"Days after an RFQ is sent before the first (gentle) follow-up email is sent "
"to the vendor."
msgstr ""
"Nombre de jours après l'envoi d'une demande de prix avant l'envoi du premier "
"e-mail de relance (courtois) au fournisseur."

#. module: no_rfq_follow_up
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:no_rfq_follow_up.field_res_config_settings__rfq_reminder_offset_2
msgid ""
"Days after an RFQ is sent before the second (firm) follow-up email is sent. "
"Should be larger than the first reminder."
msgstr ""
"Nombre de jours après l'envoi d'une demande de prix avant l'envoi du deuxième "
"e-mail de relance (ferme). Doit être supérieur au délai du premier rappel."

#. module: no_rfq_follow_up
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:no_rfq_follow_up.field_purchase_order__display_name
